sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Patient
    participant MC as Medical Core
    participant AI as AI Services
    participant BC as Banking Core
    participant PM as Payment Service
    
    P->>MC: Register Patient
    MC->>MC: PatientRegistered
    MC->>BC: CustomerCreated (Event)
    BC->>BC: AccountCreated
    BC-->>MC: AccountCreated (Event)
    
    MC->>MC: Schedule Visit
    MC->>MC: StudyOrdered
    MC->>AI: StudyCompleted (Event)
    
    AI->>AI: AnalysisRequested
    AI->>AI: InferenceCompleted
    AI-->>MC: PredictionGenerated (Event)
    
    MC->>MC: TreatmentPrescribed
    MC->>PM: InvoiceGenerated (Event)
    
    PM->>PM: PaymentInitiated
    PM->>BC: PaymentCompleted (Event)
    BC->>BC: AccountUpdated
    BC-->>PM: TransactionRecorded (Event)
    
    PM-->>MC: PaymentProcessed (Event)
    MC->>MC: TreatmentConfirmed
